# MeikonShaders 冥婚 ―MEIKON― - option labels (English)
profile.LOW=Low
profile.MEDIUM=Medium
profile.HIGH=High
profile.comment=Quality preset. Low uses coarse shadows and no light shafts; High uses fine, soft shadows.

screen.POST=Image
screen.POST.comment=Film grain, vignette, chromatic aberration and bloom.
screen.ATMOSPHERE=Fog & Air
screen.ATMOSPHERE.comment=Fog density and moonlight shafts in the fog.
screen.LIGHTING=Light & Shadow
screen.LIGHTING.comment=Moon shadows, flame flicker and the hand-held light.

option.FLASH_REDUCTION=Flash Reduction
option.FLASH_REDUCTION.comment=For photosensitive players: no glitches, no frame jitter, no heartbeat-pulsing vignette, no flashing red in a chase, and a calmer flame flicker.
option.BRIGHTNESS=Brightness
option.BRIGHTNESS.comment=Overall brightness. Raise it if you cannot see anything (the horror mood gets a little weaker).

option.FILM_GRAIN=Film Grain
option.FILM_GRAIN.comment=Old-film grain. In Kakuriyo it grows stronger with fear.
option.VIGNETTE=Vignette
option.VIGNETTE.comment=Darkens the corners. In Kakuriyo it closes in with fear and beats with your heart.
option.CHROMATIC_ABERRATION=Chromatic Aberration
option.CHROMATIC_ABERRATION.comment=Colour fringes at the edges. Stronger at high fear and while the bride hunts you.
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH=Bloom
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH.comment=Soft glow of lanterns, andon lamps, candles, the torii and the red moon.

option.FOG_DENSITY=Fog Density
option.FOG_DENSITY.comment=In Kakuriyo the corridors fade to black about 20 blocks away. Lower it to see further.
option.VOLUMETRIC_FOG=Moonlight Shafts
option.VOLUMETRIC_FOG.comment=Moonlight falling through the fog between the eaves and the torii in the courtyard. Turn off if it is too slow.
option.VOLUMETRIC_SAMPLES=Light Shaft Quality
option.VOLUMETRIC_SAMPLES.comment=Samples per pixel for the light shafts. More is smoother but slower.

option.SHADOWS=Shadows
option.SHADOWS.comment=Shadows cast by the moon (by the sun in the overworld).
option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow Resolution
option.shadowMapResolution.comment=Higher gives finer shadow edges but is slower.
option.SHADOW_FILTER=Shadow Quality
option.SHADOW_FILTER.comment=Number of samples that soften the shadow edges.
value.SHADOW_FILTER.1=Low (4)
value.SHADOW_FILTER.2=Medium (8)
value.SHADOW_FILTER.3=High (12)
option.FLAME_FLICKER=Flame Flicker
option.FLAME_FLICKER.comment=The light of lanterns, andon lamps, candles and torches gently flickers.
option.HAND_LANTERN_LIGHT=Hand-held Light
option.HAND_LANTERN_LIGHT.comment=A held lantern or torch lights its surroundings with a smooth, swaying light.
option.WAVING_PLANTS=Waving Plants
option.WAVING_PLANTS.comment=Grass, leaves and the paper streamers of the shimenawa stir faintly.
